@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
rectangle "Projudi\nJava / LogPs" as app
database "Oracle\nPROJUDI.LOG" as log
database "Oracle\nPROJUDI.PROC" as proc
component "ClickHouseLogWriter\n(fila + batch + retry)" as writer
component "Debezium Oracle\nLogMiner" as dbz
queue "Kafka\ntópico CDC" as kafka
database "ClickHouse\nprojudi_logs.log_raw" as chlog
database "ClickHouse\nprojudi_historico.proc_cdc" as chcdc
app --> writer : registro aplicacional
writer --> chlog : JDBC
app --> log : legado / fallback
proc --> dbz : redo log
dbz --> kafka : eventos JSON
kafka --> chcdc : Kafka engine + MV
note bottom of chlog
Preserva os 13 campos do log
e os payloads sem parsing
end note
note bottom of chcdc
Histórico append-only:
c/u/d/r + SCN + timestamp
end note
@enduml
